WEBVTT

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:08.760
Somebody is trying to attract your attention at that window up there.

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:32.060
No, no, no, right here.

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:57.410
One of these wires was deliberately trying to get rid of you.

00:02:58.100 --> 00:02:58.810
Why?

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:03.630
I'm supposed to be a writer.

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:06.690
Good heavens, I don't want to be the object of suspicion to anyone.

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:10.700
Oh, honorable master, the period of incarceration is ended.

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:13.580
One small willy fool has been released from during fire.

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:15.690
Please, master, you are in good health?

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:16.850
Oh, I'm all right, Willie.

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:18.990
You're a little bit better than all right, Andrews,

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:21.530
because this thing has removed a very nasty suspicion,

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:24.510
which I don't mind admitting I was harboring against you.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:25.800
Wait, our kids?

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:26.920
Against me?

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:27.360
Yes.

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:27.840
But why?

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:30.000
Because I don't think you'd hardly blow yourself up just to prove...

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:34.350
you're innocent. I'm afraid you'll have to look a little bit farther than Chinatown before you find

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:38.710
the cause of these disturbances. Let's move out of here. It's getting a little too public. Good, I can do

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:54.810
with a cup of tea. My friend, now I may make a satisfactory report to my superior. You have but one

00:03:54.810 --> 00:04:00.000
superior now, Sonia. What, sir? I have no time to talk. Time to see together.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:02.360
It is now seven minutes to three.

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:04.270
You will go immediately to the apartment.

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:07.400
And if it's exactly three o'clock, you will telephone Dr. Wu.

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:10.900
The answer, you will speak to him in Chinese, understand?

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:12.220
Yes.

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:13.160
Do as I say.

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:14.100
I will explain later.

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:25.040
The region of Chinatown must be guarded.

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:28.480
No white person not having legitimate business is allowed to enter.

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:29.270
Get it?

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:31.020
And here's something else.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:32.870
Don't give this to any of the papers.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:34.300
Right.

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:37.650
What do you mean you're going over to see Dr. Wu?

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:38.990
Haven't you caused enough trouble?

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:41.500
I'm not, Ledger.

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:44.620
I'm tired of the way you're pulling me and kicking me around.

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:49.380
If I want to go see Dr. Wu, I'll go see him, and it's none of your business.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.080
Oh, but it is my business, Lou.

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:53.000
I feel responsible for you.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:56.510
Do you, Marty?

00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:57.670
Of course I do.

00:04:58.140 --> 00:05:00.000
You haven't, and you never have had this life.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:06.480
this idea of how to take care of yourself is that so he says you martin andrews i'm in this thing and

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:18.790
i'm going to stay in it until the end and you or nobody else can stop me that honorable master not

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:24.170
innocent of making boner himself on the contrary willie your honorable master has been very very

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:29.670
clever now we wanted to get rid of the girl she's gone never look a gift horse in the mouth willie

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:33.460
You're an example, madam.

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:36.210
A genuine piece of antique language.

00:05:37.590 --> 00:05:38.350
Sorry, Mr. Rune.

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:40.090
Lady, you'll have to get out of here.

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:41.670
Chinatown is closed to tourists.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:42.980
Closed to tourists?

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:44.540
Why, this is outrageous.

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:46.340
Dr. Rune, may I speak to you?

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:50.010
In your moment, Miss Rating, I can't breathe with you at once.

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:53.000
I tell you, my man, my congressman will hear this.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:54.430
I'll get your badge.

00:05:54.730 --> 00:05:57.570
I wouldn't be surprised, lady, and I think it'll look fine on you.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:58.130
Goodbye.

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:00.000
You were 13, Mrs. Rune?

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:06.440
Yes, I do. You still suspect Martin Andrews to be back of his trouble in Chinatown, don't you, Doctor?

00:06:06.990 --> 00:06:11.300
Yes, Miss Whitehead. I do suspect Martin Andrews.

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:19.690
But, Doctor, that's impossible. If Martin had been guilty, he would never have tried to blow himself up, now would he?

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:24.820
It is what is known in this country as establishing an alibi.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:29.410
Hey, Wolf. Sorry to bother you.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:30.850
Let me see your minute.

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:31.730
At once.

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:36.320
It would give me great pleasure to continue this interesting conversation.

00:06:37.320 --> 00:06:43.700
Perhaps we'd be more free from interrupting if you would await me in my humble quarters.

00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:44.860
Certainly, Doctor.

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:50.940
Writing.

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:51.950
Yes.

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:58.170
On a table in my humble quarters, you may find a copy of your friend's extra novel.

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:00.000
You may refer.

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:05.740
memory by reading the chapter which ends with the explosion of a man home.

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:09.270
Yes, certainly if you wish, Doctor.

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:15.880
Now I'm at your service.

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:43.850
Not to lunch.

00:09:44.630 --> 00:09:45.790
Clean sometimes.

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:46.770
Won't you?

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:18.770
girl answered and told me to try again sometime. What does that mean? Me? I tell you. One of

00:10:18.770 --> 00:10:19.950
our victims had escaped.

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:33.380
This time I let that little mink do the springing.

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:34.480
Wait for me here.

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:36.450
Don't leave on the Irish side.

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:43.850
I'm sitting over there reading when a man came through the windows.

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:46.710
I recall reading this trick in Martin's book.

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:48.390
Save my life.

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:50.820
I'm your most humble servant.

00:10:52.060 --> 00:10:54.220
How shall I ever be able to repay you?

00:10:55.270 --> 00:10:56.540
Very simply, Doctor.

00:10:56.940 --> 00:10:58.180
Just give Martin a break.

00:10:58.240 --> 00:10:59.380
That's all I ask.

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:05.730
realize that even if he were capable of committing murder, he'd never stick to a madman's trick

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:14.020
like this. When madness is in the air, even these things are affected. Then you do think

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:19.890
him guilty. Very well, I'll go to him. I'll tell him what you think and I'll make him

00:11:19.890 --> 00:11:21.130
prove his innocence to you.

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:33.400
Keep going straight ahead, sister.

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:34.320
You heard what he said.

00:11:34.480 --> 00:11:34.920
Keep going.

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:02.380
underpaid scientist.

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:05.630
Now, because the underpaid scientist

00:12:05.630 --> 00:12:08.190
has presumed to give orders

00:12:08.190 --> 00:12:09.620
instead of taking them,

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:11.360
you're angry, huh?

00:12:13.050 --> 00:12:15.270
You're afraid that you, like Frankenstein,

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:17.250
have created a monster

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:19.590
who shall turn and devour you.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:21.220
Victor, I don't understand.

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:23.330
What are we doing here?

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:26.470
Why did you have me call Dr. Wu?

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:28.310
Chinatown is closed.

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:29.290
Our mission is finished.

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:29.510
Yes.

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:31.750
Our mission is not finished, Sonya.

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:36.040
Our real mission will never be finished.

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:42.160
My bitter hatred for the racers who hold us in contempt and regard us as inferiors

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:48.590
will never cease as long as they have the power to force their will upon us.

00:12:48.820 --> 00:12:50.060
You hate them that much.

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:51.120
And so should you.

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:54.720
Don't you long for revenge?

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:56.040
I do.

00:12:57.160 --> 00:12:59.690
Yes, I hate them too.

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:04.090
Well, why should we waste our time on Martin Andrews and that girl?

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:05.440
They're not important to me.

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:11.980
The ruination of those raids on the West Coast is the first step of my plans.

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:14.640
They are the friends of the Chinese.

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:15.770
They are in my way.

00:13:16.050 --> 00:13:16.850
They must be eliminated.

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:18.940
I shan't be a party to it.

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:20.290
It's murder.

00:13:21.090 --> 00:13:22.470
You can't afford to quit now.

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:26.770
The police are searching for the person who has instigated these riots.

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:29.410
Well...

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:33.590
Here, one and the other stand by.

00:13:33.810 --> 00:13:34.430
I might need you.

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:35.200
Right.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:42.390
Well, my dear, are you with me or against me?

00:13:43.730 --> 00:13:46.750
Do you value my friendship and discretion?

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:48.870
You give me no choice, Victor.

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:50.610
Come with me.

00:15:21.050 --> 00:15:21.650
Quite, my dear.

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:26.250
You think these things happen by accident?

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:29.120
So you've poisoned Martin Andrews' telephone.

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:29.600
Yes.

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:53.310
Yes, I'm afraid I'm in this thing up to the neck.

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:55.190
Unless I do something pretty quick.

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:58.040
Those fellows, whoever they are, are likely to get me.

00:16:00.220 --> 00:16:30.000
I'll take it.

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:36.180
See, since I assume command, our work progresses.

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:37.750
The End
